{"id":"f97e4de0d3796dd5","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization.md","title":"最一般统一子的相互因子化","display":"lem-mgu-mutual-factorization — 最一般统一子的相互因子化","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization","aliases":["72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization"],"display":"lem-mgu-mutual-factorization — 最一般统一子的相互因子化","depends_on":["[[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]]","[[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §2.5 print648/PDF660; full local MGU-contract consequences","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-mgu-mutual-factorization — 最一般统一子的相互因子化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"03ecee8b72b25180\" href=\"?note=03ecee8b72b25180\" title=\"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier\">72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3ef46815f85bb26e\" href=\"?note=3ef46815f85bb26e\" title=\"72-lem-program-substitution-composition\">72-lem-program-substitution-composition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §2.5 print648/PDF660; full local MGU-contract consequences"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq T^2\">\\(E\\subseteq T^2\\)</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\eta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta,\\eta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 都满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MGU}(E,\\cdot)\">\\(\\operatorname{MGU}(E,\\cdot)\\)</span>。不预先假设它们幂等，也不将它们识别为相同函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\delta,\\zeta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\quad\n\\eta=\\theta\\star\\delta\\ \\land\\ \\theta=\\eta\\star\\zeta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\delta,\\zeta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\quad\n\\eta=\\theta\\star\\delta\\ \\land\\ \\theta=\\eta\\star\\zeta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\quad\n\\operatorname{Unif}(E,\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ (\\sigma=\\theta\\star\\delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\quad\n\\operatorname{Unif}(E,\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ (\\sigma=\\theta\\star\\delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式把η作为θ最一般性中的统一子，再交换角色。第二式正向为定义，反向利用 E 中每对项在θ后相同，继续施δ仍相同；项代入复合引理保证所写函数合成方向正确。本节点只给足够一般且无附加正规形式假设的结论，不从相互因子化直接推出θ=η。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier","status":"resolved","id":"03ecee8b72b25180","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-program-substitution-composition","status":"resolved","id":"3ef46815f85bb26e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta,\\eta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MGU}(E,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\delta,\\zeta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\quad\n\\eta=\\theta\\star\\delta\\ \\land\\ \\theta=\\eta\\star\\zeta.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\quad\n\\operatorname{Unif}(E,\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ (\\sigma=\\theta\\star\\delta).","display":true}],"bytes":1640,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增6项：[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]] · [[72-ex-cyclic-term-equation]] · [[72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution]] · [[72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch]] · [[72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization]] · [[72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增6项：[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]] · [[72-ex-cyclic-term-equation]] · [[72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution]] · [[72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch]] · [[72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization]] · [[72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check]]"},{"id":"84ad7d4ebd289e58","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增6项：